ool for smokers who=E2=80=99d like to quit. <br><br>However, non-smokers =
=E2=80=94 especially tech workers in Silicon Valley =E2=80=94&nbsp;have beg=
un using nicotine as a stimulant, <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/=
