style=3D"font-style: italic;">WSJ </span>that, as someone with ADHD, it hel=
ps him focus. <br><br>The preferred method of delivery is a flavored pouch,=
 such as those produced by startups Lucy Nicotine and Sesh, that people tuc=
k between their gums and teeth. <br><br>Palantir Technologies currently has=
