ouches free for anyone 21 and up. <br><br><span style=3D"font-weight: bold;=
 font-size: 18px;">Is it dangerous?</span> <br><br>Compared to smoking ciga=
rettes =E2=80=94 the leading risk factor for lung cancer =E2=80=94&nbsp;no.=
 <br><br>But nicotine is still an addictive substance with potential <a hre=
