esions</a> he'd seen among pouch users that were so deep, the roots of near=
by teeth were visible. <br><br>There's also concern that pouch users might =
seek out nicotine in other, more harmful forms, including cigarettes. <br><=
br>And perhaps it's mildly dystopian to think about companies supplying a h=
